{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日雪降った〜ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しくて嬉しくて外に出ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はビル風は耐えられないけど冬の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪の寒さは耐えれる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪が大好きだから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スキー行きたい症候群がピークに達した。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"分かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"免許とろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レンタカー借りてスキーしに行こう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも新幹線に乗ってのんびり行くのもいいよねっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今シーズンいけるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/02/08/5018151/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いけど、ほっぺた冷たくなるけどそれがいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか綺麗になる気がするんだっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！☆"}],"source":"archive"}